   "source": [
    "Imagine you're taking an open-book exam.\n",
    "\n",
    "You don't memorize the entire textbook.\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead, when a question is asked:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. You search the textbook.\n",
    "2. You find the relevant page.\n",
    "3. You read it.\n",
    "4. You answer the question.\n",
    "\n",
    "A Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system works exactly the same way."
   ]
  }
 ],
